### Production Considerations
- **Scalability**: Use Redis for pub/sub in multi-instance deployments
- **Security**: Implement token-based authentication and message validation
- **Reliability**: Add connection recovery and message acknowledgment
- **Performance**: Implement message batching and compression
- **Monitoring**: Track connection metrics and error rates

### Anti-Patterns to Avoid
- ❌ No authentication for WebSocket connections
- ❌ Broadcasting to all clients without filtering
- ❌ No rate limiting for message frequency
- ❌ No cleanup of disconnected clients
- ❌ Storing sensitive data in plain text

### Quality Gates
- [ ] Token-based authentication
- [ ] Connection rate limiting
- [ ] Message validation and sanitization
- [ ] Automatic reconnection with backoff
- [ ] Room-based message routing
- [ ] Connection monitoring and metrics
- [ ] Error handling and recovery
- [ ] Message acknowledgment system